Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:04.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.45,0:00:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是万圣节啊 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Halloween, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.16,0:00:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于我们而言 每天都是万圣节\N{\fnArial\fs30}For us, every day is Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.57,0:00:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡之神是万圣节的来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samhain is the damn origin of Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔特人相信10月31日晚是一年之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Celts believed that October 31st was the one night of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.95,0:00:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,生与死之间的隔膜最薄弱的一夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the veil was thinnest between the living and the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们今年应该过一次 - 过一次什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should have one this year. - Have one what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去整棵树 买个波士顿烤鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get a tree, a little Boston Market.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.51,0:00:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像小时候一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like when we were little.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是情人节\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Valentine's day,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.17,0:00:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最喜欢的节日 记起来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}your favorite holiday, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老管它叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what do you always call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,「自由浪子的圣诞节」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Unattached drifter Christmas"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们人类称他们为「丘比特」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people called him "Cupid."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.56,0:00:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他其实是低等天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's actually a lower order of angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说 他们是小天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, it's a cherub,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第三阶天使 - 要的要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- third class.- Yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是开战了吗 我们要开打了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a fight? Are we in a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.77,0:00:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们问好的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is their handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来 我们是紧密相连的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future. We're bonded. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是释放了我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who set me free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那只是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我必将在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I will be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.58,0:00:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's… ‭that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将成为一体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不想那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:48.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.82,0:00:57.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（情人节）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:03.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄亥俄州 哈德森）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.25,0:01:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 亲爱的 我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, honey. Let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟我们认识那天一样帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}As handsome as the day I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯黛茜不会敲门吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't Staci know to knock?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.16,0:01:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要吵醒缇根了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll wake Teagan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.13,0:01:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我按下铃才想起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remembered after I rang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.61,0:01:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅丽莎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where's Melissa?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.26,0:01:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's getting ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.19,0:02:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能尝到她的老妈口红味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eww, I can taste her mom lipstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.93,0:02:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚会告诉她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling her tonight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是情人节\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.95,0:02:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.85,0:02:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样太无情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.45,0:02:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能回头再说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we talk about this later?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.55,0:02:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.71,0:02:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了 没那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I told you it's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅丽和我还像你这么大时就在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mel and I, we've been together since we were your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.45,0:02:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一个家 有个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We… we have a house, a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有共同的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a whole life together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 你还不懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan, don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正是我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.89,0:02:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么你今晚就告诉她 否则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either tell her tonight, or…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅丽莎 你真美啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melissa, you look so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的口红\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love your lipstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.36,0:02:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:02:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真爱 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}True love, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都继续吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So everyone just, uh, go back to your sloppy tots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了吗 真的走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he gone? Like, gone, gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.06,0:03:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真爱可以带我们离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}True love can get us out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-hey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 我爱过一百万次了 - 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I've been in love a million times. - Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.81,0:03:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真美啊 迈克 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's beautiful, Mike. It really…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这黑莓红茶简直太好喝了 辛迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bramble grey tea is simply divine, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想为不体谅你哀悼的情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to apologize for being so insensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}to your grieving emotional state.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 艺术品真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful artwork, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说事实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say it is is how it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.03,0:03:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得瞎子都看得出\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think a blind man could see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝只想离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Beth is looking for the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不在乎 都注意到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely have a reason to care and even I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 里克 别那么说我爸妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Rick! Don't talk about my parents like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.67,0:03:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 莫迪 我也不想戳破\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Morty, I hate to break it to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但人们所谓的「爱」 只是一种化学反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what people call "love" is just a chemical reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,促使动物繁殖\N{\fnArial\fs30}that compels animals to breed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.55,0:03:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,起初很强烈 莫迪 然后就慢慢消散\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hits hard, Morty, then it slow fades,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你被一段失败的婚姻束缚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving you stranded in a failing marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.53,0:03:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走出来了 你父母也会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it. Your parents are gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.64,0:03:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,打破循环吧 莫迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break the cycle, Morty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.79,0:04:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared the hell out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.75,0:04:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check on your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫迪 把螺丝刀给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morty, hand me that screwdriver, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.42,0:04:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的离子分离器就要做好了 莫迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm almost finished making my ionic defibulizer, Morty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.76,0:04:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,会很棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.47,0:04:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, Rick. You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.41,0:04:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第11季第13集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.79,0:04:45.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（少女死于「心碎」）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,早啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.01,0:05:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是吻痕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a hickey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天是情人节\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是个情种 这又没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't help it if I'm a hopeless romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got half of that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.01,0:05:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是在尽公民义务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just doing my civic duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.09,0:05:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助各种单身女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helping all the single ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道2月14日最棒的一点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the best thing about February 14th?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不非得是真命天子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be Mr. Right…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.11,0:05:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要出现得及时就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just Mr. Right Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.45,0:05:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有档次\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's classy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.95,0:05:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧不起我 那你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? What'd you do, judgy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜷在你被窝里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curl up in your snuggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:42.82,Title,0,0,0,0,,- 看电视上播的《五十度灰》吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch "50 shades" on cable? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.53,0:05:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.48,0:05:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯黛茜·奥特门 19岁的保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staci Altman, 19-year-old babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄亥俄州 哈德森人 昨晚被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Hudson, Ohio, was murdered last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.16,0:05:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that blows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.74,0:06:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果她不叫阿玛拉 跟我们何干\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if her name's not Amara, how is that us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她的心脏被扯了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because her heart was ripped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在情人节吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On Valentine's Day? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.80,0:06:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是讽刺狼人干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it, like, an ironic werewolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先 我需要培根\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, first, I need bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.31,0:06:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 首先 你得冲个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, first, you need a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是不是… - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it… - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.19,0:06:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.61,0:06:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟警察都说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like we told the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.10,0:06:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯黛茜大概6点左右到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staci came over around 6:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.93,0:06:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去吃饭了 等回到家时就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went to dinner, and by the time we got home…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在客厅发现了斯黛茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh… we found Staci in the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.86,0:06:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她躺在血泊中 缇根在摇篮里大哭大闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a pool blood and Teagan, in her crib, hysterical.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:06:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想到会有什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you think of any reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么原因想伤害斯黛茜的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}why somebody would want to hurt Staci?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.79,0:07:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯黛茜很善良 很受欢迎 又漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staci was super-sweet and popular and pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个认识她的人都会爱上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone who met her fell in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是激情犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe it was a crime of passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯黛茜有疯狂前男友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, did Staci have any crazy ex-boyfriends?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.09,0:07:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 至少我是不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. N-not that I know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.48,0:07:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么可能知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-why would I have any idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.26,0:07:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢了什么东西没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was anything stolen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会是抢劫升级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance this may have been a robbery gone wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没丢东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, nothing was missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.95,0:07:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了起居室里的保姆摄像机\N{\fnArial\fs30}except for the nanny cam in the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.64,0:07:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.68,0:07:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果想到什么就打给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a call if something comes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我觉得那人的反应有点怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it just me, or is that guy acting a bit hinky?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我也觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I was thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.99,0:08:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分头行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你送我去停尸房\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drop me at the morgue,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.97,0:08:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后去办公室找丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can hit Dan at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.15,0:08:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 或许老婆不在场他会更坦白一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and maybe he'll be a little bit more open without wifey around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,从尸检情况来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on the autopsy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,被害人心脏被扯出时她是清醒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the vic was conscious when her heart was ripped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.31,0:08:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想看到那个场面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't want a front-row seat to that show.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.27,0:08:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,能想到会是什么东西干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any ideas what could have done this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般来说 我会推定是动物袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Typically? I'd assume animal attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可这是在民居里 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In a house? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.40,0:08:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且又没有动物爪印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, no claw marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你老实说吧 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be honest with you, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做验尸20多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been doing this for some 20-odd years,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回是难住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm stumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.15,0:08:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想见你 哈珀先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's here to see you, Mr. Harper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.57,0:09:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局的维勒特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI… an Agent Weller?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,请他进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send him in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐吧 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Have a seat, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么可以帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I help you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.09,0:09:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你跟我实话实说 丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you be straight with me, Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.85,0:09:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白你的意思 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure what you mean, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.32,0:09:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.03,0:09:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你有所隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且不想当着你妻子的面说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't want to talk about it in front of your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟保姆有一腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're schtupping the babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.39,0:09:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.54,0:09:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别装生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't act all fake offended.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.33,0:09:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在帮你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually trying to help you out here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.69,0:09:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我个人根本不在乎你睡谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, personally, I don't a give rat's ass who you screw.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不希望你的「课余活动」\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I would just hate for your, uh, extracurricular activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.09,0:09:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,害你卷进一宗联邦凶杀案调查之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get you involved in a federal murder investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我也可以去找你妻子谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I could just go talk to your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你说实话 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be straight with you, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.66,0:10:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的想 但我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really do, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.87,0:10:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.77,0:10:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 真的 这事太怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, really, I mean, this is just too damn weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.70,0:10:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会相信我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… you'd never believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.43,0:10:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 是失踪的保姆摄像机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess… the missing nanny cam?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.43,0:10:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确跟斯黛茜有私情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was having an affair with Staci.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿走保姆摄像机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only took the nanny cam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为她在摄像机前吻过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}because she kissed me in front of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘记那东西摆在那里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot the damn thing was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我本想等一回家就抹去记录的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I was gonna erase it as soon as we got home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.86,0:10:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果我们却看到了斯黛茜的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then we found Staci's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.49,0:10:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅丽莎上楼去看孩子了 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melissa went upstairs to the baby, and I…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.51,0:10:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就去拿摄像机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ran for the cam?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这很混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it was a dick move,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也知道摄像机一定拍下了杀人过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I also know the cam must have recorded the murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.02,0:10:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抹去了那一吻后\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I erased the kiss,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:11:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,本打算把摄像机交给警方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna turn it over to the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.11,0:11:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我看到了上面的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I saw what was on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那是我 但那真不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that's me, but I swear it wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.27,0:11:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会伤害斯黛茜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never hurt Staci.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.07,0:11:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时一直在餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was at a dinner the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.93,0:12:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不信 可以问梅丽莎和侍应生\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't believe me, ask Melissa or the waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.41,0:12:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他75位客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or any of the 75 other people that were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.67,0:12:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.81,0:12:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事暂时不要说出去 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep a lid on this for the time being, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah… jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.65,0:12:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没有表明是狼人的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely nothing points to a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.35,0:12:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠边站吧 书呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step aside, Urkel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是丹偷走了保姆摄像机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Dan that stole the nanny cam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.13,0:12:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟保姆有一腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was schtupping the sitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.81,0:13:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为丹当时跟梅丽莎去吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Dan was at dinner with Melissa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.86,0:13:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.54,0:13:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shapeshifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.03,0:13:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yahtzee.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.07,0:13:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is okay if I head out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.91,0:13:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 哈珀先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay, Mr. Harper?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果需要 我愿意留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy to stay if you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.62,0:13:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你该回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe you should go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.69,0:13:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟家人待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be with your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.07,0:13:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事的 格莱蒂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be okay, Gladys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.34,0:13:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你晚上愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.62,0:13:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.59,0:14:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你落东西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you forget something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.88,0:14:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯黛茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staci?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.33,0:14:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你把心给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to give me your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.22,0:14:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, this is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你的心被扯出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw your… your heart ripped out of your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:14:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.12,0:14:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.99,0:15:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.45,0:15:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最后见到活着的你老板的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the last person to see your boss alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有注意到什么不寻常的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice anything unusual?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么不寻常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing unusual, per se.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.31,0:15:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是有点粗鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kind of rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.05,0:15:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个年轻女孩 褐发 挺丰满\N{\fnArial\fs30}This young girl… brunette, buxom,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.15,0:15:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,至多就19岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't have been more than 19…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.45,0:15:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开时从电梯里走了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}barreled out of the elevator as I was leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.53,0:15:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎把我撞倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nearly knocked me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.63,0:15:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.57,0:15:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢配合 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your time, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.68,0:15:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以确认是个易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it confirms we're dealing with a shifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.55,0:16:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还耍手段扮成死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, who's upping its game by impersonating dead people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.66,0:16:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我猜是那个妻子 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm guessing it's the wife. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.17,0:16:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们深表哀悼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.85,0:16:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是…不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't… I just can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean… how is this even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就想查清这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we're trying to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.71,0:16:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.59,0:16:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在我妈妈那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's… she's with my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.19,0:16:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to have to ask this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.23,0:16:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有个不好开口的问题要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I-I need to ask you a difficult question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.36,0:16:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否知道你丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you aware that your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的保姆有私情\N{\fnArial\fs30}was having an affair with your babysitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.35,0:16:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.10,0:16:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're thinking…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫉妒妻子杀死出轨老公\N{\fnArial\fs30}jealous wife kills her cheating husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绝不是那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that couldn't be further from the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.46,0:17:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很爱丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.51,0:17:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我依然爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去或许很可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may sound pathetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.31,0:17:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我以为我们还会有机会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I thought we still had a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不打扰你了 你休息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll leave you alone, let you get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.90,0:17:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走之前 能麻烦你写一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we go, would you mind just writing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.79,0:17:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话号码给我们 万一我们再有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}a phone number where we can get ahold of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也好找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case we have any more questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.36,0:17:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果出现什么奇怪或不寻常的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if anything strange or out of the ordinary comes up,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.44,0:17:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定打给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't hesitate to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就住在主街的汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're staying at the motel on main street.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.18,0:17:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.72,0:17:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 梅丽莎不是易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so Melissa's not the shifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又回到起点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are back to square zilch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要喝一杯 调整一下 或许约一炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a beer. Regroup, maybe get lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.85,0:17:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不是才约过吗 - 那是在堪萨斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Didn't you just get lucky? - That was in Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.31,0:17:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 一起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say? You with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去酒吧泡几个心碎的妹子回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go scrape a few hearts off the barroom floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.24,0:18:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I think I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.99,0:18:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去查查传说 你做你自己去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna hit the lore, but you go be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.67,0:18:41.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（染色艺术）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.27,0:18:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I think I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.93,0:18:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么回事 但出了岔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't what happened, but something went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹死了 联调局还各种问问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Dan is dead and the FBI are asking questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽快给我回电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just call me back asap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.28,0:19:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.29,0:19:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员 是你们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.20,0:19:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:19:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.20,0:20:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.93,0:20:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 让我进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, please let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.75,0:20:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 亲爱的 我不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, honey. I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.69,0:20:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.88,0:21:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查到什么了吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, any luck? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你约到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.02,0:21:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.63,0:21:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫「老爸身体」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's a "dad bod"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 丹想杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dan tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.17,0:21:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 你死去的丈夫 丹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan, your dead husband, dan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说如果发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me to come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.24,0:21:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪或不寻常的事就来找你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if anything strange or out-of-the-ordinary happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确发生了 我觉得是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it did, and I think it's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.02,0:21:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你坐下吧 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, why don't you sit down? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.41,0:21:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.51,0:21:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是真心爱丹 或许太爱他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really did love Dan, maybe a little too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.99,0:21:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.28,0:21:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他也爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted him to love me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.76,0:22:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我去寻求建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I got some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟我的美发师袒露了他俩出轨的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I confided in my hairdresser about the affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.56,0:22:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 女人还真这么干啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Women actually do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.80,0:22:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说有办法把他赢回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she told me that there was a way to get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她…涉猎了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I knew she, uh, dabbled in stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.36,0:22:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指的是什么样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of stuff are you talking about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她自称是白女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She calls herself a… white witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.11,0:22:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你们是不是信那种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I don't know if you believe in that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.96,0:22:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一般是不信的 但我走投无路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I normally don't, but I was desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.45,0:22:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 她给了你一个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. She, uh, gave you a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.45,0:22:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 归情咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. A return-to-love spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.22,0:22:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要念咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I had to do was chant it and…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.74,0:22:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一吻封印即可\N{\fnArial\fs30}seal it with a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.64,0:22:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我并没想发生这种事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't mean for any of this to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 我只是想要回我丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear I… I just wanted my husband back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.83,0:22:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有带来一份咒语的副本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you happen to have a copy of the spell on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.41,0:22:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.20,0:23:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 首先 这不是咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, for starters, not a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.57,0:23:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是阿拉姆语诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like an Aramaic curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.10,0:23:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - This…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.75,0:23:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大致翻译过来就是「死亡之吻」\N{\fnArial\fs30}roughly translates to "The Kiss of Death""
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.93,0:23:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 这她可没说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear she never told me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.74,0:23:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说上怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does the lore say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.58,0:23:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本查不到传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I can tell, there is no lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.18,0:23:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜这是白女巫自制的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}My best guess is this was the white witch's home cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.04,0:23:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 那么我们都知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrific. All right, so what do we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.38,0:23:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吻谁谁死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, if you kiss someone, then they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess. Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.04,0:23:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没吻斯黛茜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't kiss Staci.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.28,0:23:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.61,0:23:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但丹吻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but Dan did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.00,0:23:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么诅咒还可传染吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the curse is transmittable?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.09,0:23:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像魔法性病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a magic STD.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.29,0:23:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可以有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that works.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.64,0:23:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人怀念老式的疱疹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of makes you nostalgic for good, old-fashioned herpes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.24,0:23:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.54,0:24:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害死了丹和斯黛茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed Dan and Staci.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.25,0:24:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有害死任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.25,0:24:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是那个女巫的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all on that witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.81,0:24:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riddle me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.05,0:24:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果斯黛茜是第二个被吻 为什么反而先死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did Staci die first if she was kissed second?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.25,0:24:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.25,0:24:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能把诅咒传出去自己就安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're safe if you can pass the curse on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.49,0:24:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那人死了 就又回到你这儿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then if that person dies, then it comes back to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.78,0:24:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那能说得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that would make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.60,0:24:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就难怪不管这是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would explain why whatever this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.49,0:24:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又找回到梅丽莎头上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is working its way back to Melissa.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.15,0:24:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我糊涂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.90,0:24:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这的确让人糊涂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 'cause it's freaking confusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.74,0:24:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 这就像烫手山芋游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the long and short… it's like a game of hot potato.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.66,0:24:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得一直把它往外传\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to keep paying it forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.01,0:24:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则 你就要没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.71,0:24:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅丽莎 诅咒是由你开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melissa, this curse started with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.91,0:24:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得它也要由你结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think it wants to end with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.57,0:24:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们不会让你有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry, okay? We're not gonna let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.24,0:25:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.04,0:25:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.50,0:25:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚还真是顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}I'd say that went pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.86,0:25:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.89,0:25:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你是认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.69,0:25:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得让自己染上一个致命诅咒是个好主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's a-a good idea to give yourself a fatal curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.94,0:25:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.46,0:25:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她不是目标了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, target's off her back, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.08,0:25:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想说 你不用这样的 做个小白鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying you don't have to do this… be the guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.51,0:26:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 做殉道者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - The martyr.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.19,0:26:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,想自己承担一切 做这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and carry the weight by yourself… do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.56,0:26:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be fine, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.71,0:26:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我没事 她就没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as long as I'm good, she's good,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.83,0:26:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's the important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.74,0:26:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 这证明了我们的理论 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, it proved our theory, didn't it…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.98,0:26:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,「死亡之吻」诅咒的确是可传染的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this whole "Kiss of death" curse is transmittable?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.89,0:26:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我虽然不求诺贝尔奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking for the Nobel here,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.04,0:26:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但至少说声「谢谢」啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, you know, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.42,0:26:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得我们有多长时间 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long do you think we have? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.24,0:26:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西有没什么规律可循\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like this thing is exactly following a pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.54,0:26:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道我该找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what I'm looking for here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.19,0:26:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们刚刚逃得快\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we cut out of there pretty quick…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.58,0:26:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚刚怎么回事 - 这样或许争取到了点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was that? - …So maybe that bought us some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.10,0:26:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本认为那东西是个易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, we think it was something called a shapeshifter,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.23,0:26:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这又不可能 因为我往它身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, it can't be because I pumped the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.00,0:26:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,打了一堆银而它毫不退缩\N{\fnArial\fs30}full of silver and it didn't even flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.40,0:26:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是哪门子联调局探员啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of FBI agents are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.74,0:26:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,假的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fake kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.44,0:26:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.53,0:26:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.31,0:26:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要知道我们拯救你这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, all you need to know is that we save people like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.24,0:26:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不受那样的东西的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}from things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.24,0:26:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算它不是个易形者 它还是会易形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it's not a shapeshifter, it's still shifting shapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.02,0:26:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能查明它是什么 就能想办法杀它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can figure out what it is, we can find out how to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.20,0:26:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你对白女巫有什么了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, what do you know about the white witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.94,0:27:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怎么了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, n-not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.04,0:27:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫索尼娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Sonja.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.17,0:27:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怪怪的 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's kind of weird. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.59,0:27:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也就刚做了我的美发师几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's only been my hairdresser for a couple of months.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.48,0:27:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道她住哪吗 - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you where she lives? - Uh, not a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.01,0:27:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪把咒语给你的 - 她沙龙的地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where did she give you the spell? - In the basement of her salon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.34,0:27:18.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（染色艺术）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.26,0:27:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,染色艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Art of Dyeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.09,0:27:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能说她没警告过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, can't say she didn't warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.60,0:27:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 车门锁好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, just keep the doors locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.12,0:27:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回来前别乱走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stay put until we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.54,0:27:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非索尼娅出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless Sonja shows up,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.26,0:27:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就拿这个对付她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then use this on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.69,0:27:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀不死她 但能放慢她的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't kill her, but it'll slow her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.39,0:27:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认真的吗 我不能持刀伤人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious? I can't stab anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.69,0:27:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿着 - 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.16,0:27:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼娅不是普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonja's not just anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.25,0:27:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个邪恶女巫 她杀了你丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a wicked witch who offed your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.23,0:27:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还企图杀你 如果她出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tried to kill you, so if she shows up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.28,0:27:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就揍她 捅她\N{\fnArial\fs30}you punch her, you stab her,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.31,0:27:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有必要 拿房子砸她都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}you drop a freaking house on her if you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.08,0:28:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀女巫的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witch killing bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.28,0:28:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得想个更好的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to come up with a better name than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.49,0:28:31.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（闲人止步）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.33,0:29:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,柜子锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.35,0:29:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looky there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.53,0:29:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.62,0:29:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.65,0:29:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们对付的是个灵怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, it looks like we're dealing with a qareen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.87,0:29:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.93,0:29:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种「有形生灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a "creature, corporeal in form,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.71,0:29:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全听你命令行事「\N{\fnArial\fs30}a slave to your commands""
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.78,0:29:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是很像灯神吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like a genie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.55,0:29:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧 这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.22,0:29:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,念咒 然后接吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, someone chants the curse and lays a wet one on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.52,0:29:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么被害人就会受到诱惑 被灵怪所杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the victim is seduced and killed by the qareen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.14,0:30:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但灵怪不会变成芭芭拉·伊登的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But instead of taking the form of Barbara Eden,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.30,0:30:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是呈现出你最深最黑暗的欲念的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}they present themselves as your deep, darkest desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.47,0:30:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得保姆是丈夫杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it makes sense why the sitter was killed by the husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.09,0:30:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而丈夫又被保姆所杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the husband by the sitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.69,0:30:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而梅丽莎被丹袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and why Melissa was attacked by Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.50,0:30:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是真心爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She really loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.04,0:30:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.75,0:30:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道受诅咒的好处吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the silver lining about being cursed?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.93,0:30:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于能跟黛西·杜克（电视剧人物）面对面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll finally get some face time with Daisy Duke…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.51,0:30:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最深最黑暗的欲念\N{\fnArial\fs30}…My deepest, darkest desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.32,0:30:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的假的 - 七岁起就爱上她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously? - Ever since I was 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.88,0:30:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么是凯瑟琳·巴赫的老版\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Bach,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.47,0:30:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是杰西卡·辛普森的新版喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}not Simpson.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.34,0:30:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个倒是都不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I wouldn't say no to either.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.62,0:30:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 怎么杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, how do we kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.92,0:30:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺穿心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}By stabbing it in its heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.46,0:30:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,它胸口上有个大洞啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, given that it's got a giant hole in its chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.03,0:30:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}does it even have a heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.49,0:30:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来不在他身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently not in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.45,0:30:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,持有灵怪心脏者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The person who possesses the qareen's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.66,0:30:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,能控制它\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the one who commands it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.93,0:30:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么是美发师索尼娅喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Sonja the hairdresser.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.54,0:30:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们去找心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's find us a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.28,0:30:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.84,0:31:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不管 我要去楼上 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whatever. I'm going upstairs. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.73,0:33:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.38,0:33:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}I understand, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.17,0:33:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.72,0:33:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你内心的渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The longing in your heart…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.24,0:33:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.03,0:33:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是感人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's touching…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.37,0:33:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟你根本没心\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering that you don't have a heart…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.83,0:33:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}…qareen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.30,0:34:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你并不真是联调局喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing you're not really FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.34,0:34:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.26,0:34:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.28,0:34:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.98,0:34:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把死亡诅咒当爱情魔咒卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}hocking death curses as love spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.59,0:34:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有人去惩罚那些男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone has to punish these men.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.92,0:34:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但唯一比出轨男人更糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, the only thing worse than a cheating man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.93,0:34:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是出轨还不受罚的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}is one who gets away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.01,0:34:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个女权主义者啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're practically a feminist.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.85,0:34:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是什么不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who I am doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.68,0:34:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的问题是 你是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real question is, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.27,0:34:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.15,0:34:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个谜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.16,0:34:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看清你的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see inside your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.30,0:34:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,能感觉到你的爱 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel the love you feel, except…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.15,0:34:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它裹着一层羞愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's cloaked in shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.94,0:35:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这具躯体…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it comes to this…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.39,0:35:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法自持\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.19,0:35:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那何必要抵抗呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why fight it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.87,0:35:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.53,0:35:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么伤害梅丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why hurt Melissa?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.23,0:35:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不过是想拯救自己的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}She only wanted to save her marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.84,0:35:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们都是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.92,0:35:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,上百个心碎的女人来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundreds of heartbroken women come to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.85,0:35:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她们从不吸取教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they never learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.48,0:35:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个月 一年 总有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, a month, a year, however long later,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.81,0:35:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们会再回来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}they all come back…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.12,0:35:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样的故事 不一样的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}same story, different man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.65,0:35:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就「改良」了诅咒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you tweak the curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.90,0:35:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今它不止惩罚偷腥的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it not only punishes the cheaters,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.67,0:35:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还惩罚那些希望浪子回头的蠢女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the foolish women who want them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.56,0:35:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我不过是在清除白痴而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'm just weeding out the idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.73,0:35:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你就是下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.79,0:35:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 知道吗 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know what? You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.28,0:36:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的阿玛拉的确能牵制我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real Amara does have a hold on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.30,0:36:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你什么也不是 只是个拙劣的冒牌货\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you are nothing but a cheap imitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.17,0:36:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼娅 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonja, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.80,0:36:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 适可而止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Enough is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.40,0:37:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.35,0:37:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.23,0:37:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.13,0:37:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是嘛 - 搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.64,0:37:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You good? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.92,0:37:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.20,0:37:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.89,0:38:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要继续吊我胃口吗 还是怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}So, are you gonna keep me in suspense here or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.96,0:38:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.76,0:38:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现的是谁 巴赫还是辛普森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was it? Bach or Simpson?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.13,0:38:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.44,0:38:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.55,0:38:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃惊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that surprise you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.01,0:38:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不吃惊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't surprise you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.36,0:38:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.59,0:38:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.11,0:38:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你真觉得上帝的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you seriously think the sister of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.02,0:38:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我最深最黑暗的欲念\N{\fnArial\fs30}is my deepest, darkest desire?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.78,0:38:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她不是吗 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She isn't? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.27,0:38:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.49,0:38:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么不可能 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.31,0:39:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为如果真是 那就说明我 - 说明你怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because if she was, then that means I'm… - Means you're what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.33,0:39:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,和她沆瀣一气 软弱 邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complicit? Weak? Evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.92,0:39:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,都对 还不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}For starters, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.66,0:39:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.17,0:39:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得你在这事上有选择吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you honestly think you ever had a choice in the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.05,0:39:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可是上帝的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the sister of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.68,0:39:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸 她出于某种原因选中了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for some reason, she picked you, and that sucks,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.30,0:39:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你觉得我会因此责备或者看扁你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you think I'm gonna blame you or judge you…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.06,0:39:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.71,0:39:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是想杀了她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that I want her ass dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.50,0:39:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.73,0:39:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道你或许为此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you've also probably beaten yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.10,0:39:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,自责得要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}a million times over it,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.31,0:39:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那对我们有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}but where has that gotten us?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.37,0:39:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况有多糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just how bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.43,0:39:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,此时此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing here right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.99,0:39:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无比希望能捅她一刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every bone in my body wants to run her through.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.82,0:39:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她从哪爬出来的就回哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send her back to that hole she crawled out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.30,0:39:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当我靠近她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I'm near her…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.60,0:40:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会发生一些奇怪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know… something happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.31,0:40:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.08,0:40:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要说那是欲望或爱 也不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to call it desire or love… it's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.14,0:40:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完蛋了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm screwed, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.69,0:40:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想要杀死黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to kill the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.80,0:40:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须杀死黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to kill the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.52,0:40:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't think I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.13,0:40:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉这么对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to do that to you, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.78,0:40:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但等到了关键时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when it comes down to it…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.24,0:40:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it, Dean.
